{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23006","headline":"初着刺史绯荅友人见赠 · 白居易","name":"初着刺史绯荅友人见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人安慰善爲辞，五十专城道未迟。\n徒使花袍红似火，其如蓬鬓白成丝。\n且贪薄俸君应惜，不称衰容我自知。\n银印可怜将底用，只堪归舍吓妻儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23006.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23006","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}